1. A manipulating device for gripping workpieces with a negative pressure, comprising:
a suction gripper;
a rectangular casing connected to the suction gripper and including a broad side providing a first broad face of the casing and a second broad face of the casing;
a means for generating and feeding a negative pressure disposed in the casing;
